# cppcheck suppressions, read via --suppressions-list (one rule per line).
#
# Each line is the same spec as the --suppress flag, e.g.
#   missingIncludeSystem
#   unusedFunction:src/legacy/foo.cpp
#   constParameter:src/app/model/*.h
#
# Prefer an inline `// cppcheck-suppress <id>` on the exact line (enabled by
# --inline-suppr) over a blanket rule here: it is self-documenting and moves
# with the code. Reserve this file for whole-file or whole-category
# suppressions that are justified in the commit message.
#
# Currently empty: no suppressions are justified yet. The cppcheck target is
# report-only (a baseline), so findings are recorded, not suppressed.
